OL,3,GNEWSAEye hospital demolition to take
OL,4,Aseveral months
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe demolition of a closed hospital
OL,7,Fcould take up to nine months to
OL,8,Fcomplete, with developers vowing to
OL,9,Fcelebrate its history in future plans.
OL,11,FThe former Sunderland Eye Infirmary has
OL,12,Fbeen empty since services transferred
OL,13,Fto the new #50m Specialist Eye Hospital
OL,14,Fin the city centre last month.
OL,16,FThe Queen Alexandra Road facility was
OL,17,Fopened by Queen Elizabeth II before she
OL,18,Fbecame the reigning monarch in 1946 and
OL,19,Fhousebuilder Story Homes previously
OL,20,Fsaid it wanted to build 62 homes in its
OL,21,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
