OL,3,GNEWSAEye hospital demolition to take
OL,4,Aseveral months
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe developer has now applied for
OL,7,Fpermission to Sunderland City Council
OL,8,Fto knock it down. In planning
OL,9,Fdocuments, it said would it retain part
OL,10,Fof the structure as a feature in the
OL,11,Fnew eye hospital.
